  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Bill Bolling was an American sea captain and classic-yacht restorer who built a business around returning neglected boats to service. With his wife and business partner, Patsy Kenedy, he bought, rebuilt and resold vessels while operating in the charter trade. Their working partnership combined practical restoration with a life at sea.",
